<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1418112141"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1489273380"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="From You, for Me"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Frank Pierce / Sam Vasami"/><amll:meta key="album" value="From You, for Me"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:03.330"><div begin="00:08.690" end="03:03.330"><p begin="00:08.690" end="00:11.670" itunes:key="L1">Tell me where you go, when you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你去向何方 你何时离开</span></p><p begin="00:11.670" end="00:15.850" itunes:key="L2">Since you're asking me questions, that you already know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你明明知道答案 何必多此一举</span></p><p begin="00:15.850" end="00:20.340" itunes:key="L3">Tell me what you want that you don't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你想要什么 又抵触什么</span></p><p begin="00:20.340" end="00:24.710" itunes:key="L4">Get before you request it when you know I'm alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你知道我孤身一人时 在你开口以前如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="00:24.710" end="00:28.250" itunes:key="L5">So SOS, find what's left<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">救救我 救救我 看看还剩下了什么</span></p><p begin="00:28.250" end="00:29.900" itunes:key="L6">For you to believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了让你相信</span></p><p begin="00:29.900" end="00:32.680" itunes:key="L7">I can't find rest, on my chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心力交瘁</span></p><p begin="00:32.680" end="00:34.760" itunes:key="L8">I can hardly breathe so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我几乎不能呼吸</span></p><p begin="00:34.760" end="00:37.080" itunes:key="L9">Please say less, thank you next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请少说一些话 对你感激不尽</span></p><p begin="00:37.080" end="00:38.740" itunes:key="L10">Need my boundaries<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们需要划清界线</span></p><p begin="00:38.740" end="00:42.280" itunes:key="L11">I need space, need space, need space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要足够的空间</span></p><p begin="00:42.280" end="00:45.750" itunes:key="L12">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="00:51.220" end="01:00.150" itunes:key="L13">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="01:00.150" end="01:01.060" itunes:key="L14">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="01:01.060" end="01:03.610" itunes:key="L15">Text me that you're right at the door (Right at the door)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给我发来信息 告诉我你就在我家门口</span></p><p begin="01:03.610" end="01:06.250" itunes:key="L16">And you've waited forever (Forever)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在我家门口</span></p><p begin="01:06.250" end="01:09.550" itunes:key="L17">And you won't wait no more (Won't wait no more)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不愿再苦苦等待</span></p><p begin="01:09.550" end="01:12.830" itunes:key="L18">And text me how it's always my fault<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿再苦苦等待</span></p><p begin="01:12.830" end="01:14.680" itunes:key="L19">And I never do right by you (Never do right by)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未好好待你</span></p><p begin="01:14.680" end="01:18.140" itunes:key="L20">You can always do wrong, wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是做错事</span></p><p begin="01:18.140" end="01:20.690" itunes:key="L21">So SOS, find what's left<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以发送求救信号 寻找残存的一切</span></p><p begin="01:20.690" end="01:22.320" itunes:key="L22">For you to believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了让你相信</span></p><p begin="01:22.320" end="01:25.040" itunes:key="L23">I can't find rest, on my chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心力交瘁</span></p><p begin="01:25.040" end="01:27.180" itunes:key="L24">I can hardly breathe so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我几乎不能呼吸</span></p><p begin="01:27.180" end="01:29.450" itunes:key="L25">Please say less, thank you next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请少说一些话 对你感激不尽</span></p><p begin="01:29.450" end="01:31.030" itunes:key="L26">Need my boundaries<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们需要划清界线</span></p><p begin="01:31.030" end="01:33.630" itunes:key="L27">I need space, need space, need space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要足够的空间</span></p><p begin="01:33.630" end="01:34.680" itunes:key="L28">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="01:34.680" end="01:38.090" itunes:key="L29">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="01:43.250" end="01:46.120" itunes:key="L30">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="01:52.850" end="01:57.170" itunes:key="L31">Made you laugh, made you patient<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你开怀大笑 让你变得有耐心</span></p><p begin="01:57.170" end="02:01.420" itunes:key="L32">Made you feel like you're something more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你感觉自己无与伦比</span></p><p begin="02:01.420" end="02:05.810" itunes:key="L33">Felt your voice, felt your cadence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受到你的声音 感受着你的节奏</span></p><p begin="02:05.810" end="02:10.510" itunes:key="L34">Felt it once, now I'm not too sure, ohh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经切身体会 如今我满腹疑虑</span></p><p begin="02:10.510" end="02:12.940" itunes:key="L35">So SOS, find what's left<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以发送求救信号 寻找残存的一切</span></p><p begin="02:12.940" end="02:14.670" itunes:key="L36">For you to believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了让你相信</span></p><p begin="02:14.670" end="02:17.420" itunes:key="L37">I can't find rest, on my chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心力交瘁</span></p><p begin="02:17.420" end="02:19.520" itunes:key="L38">I can hardly breathe so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我几乎不能呼吸</span></p><p begin="02:19.520" end="02:21.730" itunes:key="L39">Please say less, thank you next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请少说一些话 对你感激不尽</span></p><p begin="02:21.730" end="02:23.410" itunes:key="L40">Need my boundaries<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们需要划清界线</span></p><p begin="02:23.410" end="02:26.070" itunes:key="L41">I need space, need space, need space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要足够的空间</span></p><p begin="02:26.070" end="02:27.020" itunes:key="L42">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="02:27.020" end="02:28.230" itunes:key="L43">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p><p begin="02:28.230" end="02:31.830" itunes:key="L44">Oh yeah</p><p begin="02:31.830" end="02:34.080" itunes:key="L45">Oh yeah</p><p begin="02:34.080" end="02:41.350" itunes:key="L46">From you and for me</p><p begin="02:41.350" end="02:43.890" itunes:key="L47">Oh yeah</p><p begin="02:43.890" end="02:47.940" itunes:key="L48">So SOS, find what's left<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">救救我 救救我 我们没剩下什么</span></p><p begin="02:47.940" end="02:49.690" itunes:key="L49">For you to believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了让你相信</span></p><p begin="02:49.690" end="02:52.270" itunes:key="L50">I can't find rest, on my chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心力交瘁</span></p><p begin="02:52.270" end="02:54.380" itunes:key="L51">I can hardly breathe so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我几乎不能呼吸</span></p><p begin="02:54.380" end="02:56.680" itunes:key="L52">Please say less, thank you next<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请少说一些话 对你感激不尽</span></p><p begin="02:56.680" end="02:58.300" itunes:key="L53">Need my boundaries<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们需要划清界线</span></p><p begin="02:58.300" end="03:01.830" itunes:key="L54">I need space, need space, need space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要足够的空间</span></p><p begin="03:01.830" end="03:03.330" itunes:key="L55">From you and for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离你而去 为我着想</span></p></div></body></tt>